## NOTICE — Scope of this license

**This MIT license covers the SubSensei userscript source code only.**

The following are NOT covered by this license:

1. **The Subtitle Instrumentality Project (SIP) database.**
   All SRT files, translations, subtitle metadata, and the corresponding
   entries stored on the hosted backend remain the exclusive property of
   the author. They may not be reproduced, redistributed, bulk-downloaded,
   re-uploaded, or used to build a competing service.

2. **The hosted backend service.**
   The PocketBase instance, its schema, server-side hooks
   (`bmc_webhook.pb.js`, `server_quota.pb.js`, `subtitle_file_route.pb.js`),
   credentials, and any associated infrastructure are private and are not
   part of this repository.

3. **The brand and marks.**
   "SubSensei", "字幕老師", "Subtitle Instrumentality Project", "SIP",
   "字幕補完計劃" and associated logos may not be used to endorse or promote
   derivative works without prior written permission.

If you fork or redistribute the userscript, please run it against your own
backend — the author's hosted service (and its subtitle library) is not
provided for third-party use.

